# Missions: a mode step (Hector's Burrito Run: Courier, three delivered). The courier starts as run
# courier does (at the taqueria, the first order picked up); the third delivery wins the step, the
# game gives way to free skate, and Hector's call starts at once (phone). Done once its lines are over.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 mission start burrito 1
cmd 200 teleport -55.3 -305 2.61 356
cmd 400 teleport -235 -230 12.53 356
cmd 600 teleport -18.5 -395.2 1.94 356
cmd 700 mission next
cmd 701 mission next
run 720
expect event missionStep{mission=burrito,step=1,kind=mode} within 1..1
expect event courierPickup{leg=0} within 0..3
expect event courierDeliver{n=3} within 600..602
expect event missionStep{mission=burrito,step=2,kind=talk} within 600..602
expect event talk{character=hector,line=burrito-06,n=0} within 600..602
expect session.mode == free at 650
expect event missionDone{mission=burrito,sticker=side-burrito} within 702..702
expect no event courierOver
